# EM score-reel layout (real reel artwork via the live Image visual)
# Sized to the full 2x2 backglass composite aspect (4 player scores in a 2x2
# grid + a centered ball-in-play / credit row underneath). The box resizes to
# this Width/Height via SetScoreViewSourceSize(layout.width/height); the actual
# pixel image is pushed at runtime by ReelDmd, and Fit: Contain frames it.
#
# Reference composite (Royal Flush, gottlieb_reel 85x170 cells): the grid is
# ~1041x501 px (aspect ~2.08:1). These Width/Height keep that aspect at a sane
# scale (<= 512). Tables with different reel art shift the pixel size but the
# Contain fit keeps it centered.

Width: 512
Height: 246
Fit: Contain

Visuals:
	- Image:
		Rect: [0,0,512,246]
		Src: ctrl://reel
